            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> rdae:dancer;
            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a performer contributing to an expression of a work by dancing in a musical, dramatic, etc., presentation."@en.
rdae:P20015 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "teacher"@en;
