            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/a/P50074>;
            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> rdae:teacher;
            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a performer contributing to an expression of a work by giving instruction or providing a demonstration."@en.
rdae:P20016 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "host"@en;
            <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001>;
