            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> rdae:puppeteer;
            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a performer contributing to an expression of a work by manipulating, controlling, or directing puppets or marionettes in a moving image production or a musical or dramatic presentation or entertainment."@en.
rdae:P20019 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "panelist"@en;
