            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a performer contributing to an expression of a work by playing a musical instrument."@en.
rdae:P20021 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "commentator"@en;
            <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001>;
