            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> rdae:commentator;
            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a performer contributing to an expression of a work by providing interpretation, analysis, or a discussion of the subject matter on a recording, film, or other audiovisual medium."@en.
rdae:P20022 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "narrator"@en;
            <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001>;
