            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a performer contributing to an expression of a work by reading or speaking in order to give an account of an act, occurrence, course of events, etc."@en.
rdae:P20023 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "storyteller"@en;
